00:45:26,200 --> 00:45:29,760
他们要超我了。
天哪，这简直是折磨。
They are gonna overtake me.
Oh, this is torture.

775
00:45:32,880 --> 00:45:35,800
我们的地速
接近145节。
We have a ground speed
of nearly 145 knots.

776
00:45:35,840 --> 00:45:38,960
-那大概是多少？
时速150英里？
-快得飞起。
-That's about what?
150 miles an hour?
-Corking speed.

777
00:45:43,400 --> 00:45:46,200
“龟速船长”开着他的破洗衣机
在上面飞着呢。
Captain Slow is up there
in his washing machine.

778
00:45:47,800 --> 00:45:50,240
我绝不能
输给一台洗衣机。
I will not be beaten
by a washing machine.

779
00:45:52,680 --> 00:45:56,600
克拉克森：
是时候亮出布加迪的秘密武器了。
CLARKSON:
It was time to unleash the
Bugatti's secret weapon.

780
00:45:56,640 --> 00:45:59,880
眼下我还处于三级戒备状态。
At the moment I'm in DEFCON 3.

781
00:45:59,920 --> 00:46:02,560
处于操控模式下，尾翼是升起来的，
I'm in handling mode
with that rear spoiler up,

782
00:46:02,600 --> 00:46:07,320
把车尾死死压在路面上，
好给过弯提供足够的抓地力。
which is pushing the back of
the car into the road to give
me grip in the corners.

783
00:46:09,200 --> 00:46:13,000
可我现在是在高速公路上，连个弯道都没有。
But I am on a motorway
and there are no corners.

784
00:46:16,600 --> 00:46:20,160
克拉克森：
所以这尾翼纯粹是在产生风阻，拖我后腿。
CLARKSON:
So all the spoiler's doing is
causing drag, slowing me down.

785
00:46:20,200 --> 00:46:23,320
因此我得靠边停车，把它降下去。
I therefore needed to
pull over and lower it.

786
00:46:25,320 --> 00:46:27,240
为了防止你手贱误操作降下尾翼，
To make sure you don't put it
down accidentally,

787
00:46:27,280 --> 00:46:31,240
你必须把点火钥匙
插进这里的插槽。
you have to use the ignition
key in this slot here.

788
00:46:31,280 --> 00:46:35,520
这样一来，
当你全油门狂飙时，
尾翼就不会升起来了。
So that now,
when you get cracking,
the spoiler doesn't come up.

789
00:46:35,560 --> 00:46:39,200
而且整辆车会贴地紧趴在路面上，
风阻变得极小，
And the whole car hunkers
down on the road. Makes it
very slippery,

790
00:46:39,240 --> 00:46:41,200
你就能冲到极速了。
and you can get
to the top speed.

791
00:46:41,240 --> 00:46:45,000
但在你这么做之前，
大众表示你得先做一系列检查。
But before you can do that,
Volkswagen say you have
to do some checks.

792
00:46:47,360 --> 00:46:50,320
鬼知道都要查些什么，所以……
No idea what these
checks might be, so...

793
00:46:53,040 --> 00:46:54,880
看着挺好。
Seems fine.

794
00:46:54,920 --> 00:46:58,000
我现在进入四级戒备了。
I am now at DEFCON 4.

795
00:47:10,360 --> 00:47:14,600
到了这一刻，坐飞机的巨大优势
确实开始显现出来了，
At this point, your big
advantage about flying
does start to pay off,

796
00:47:14,640 --> 00:47:17,680
因为我们在天上，一路上畅通无阻，
直奔目的地。
because we are in the sky,
there's nothing is in the way,
we're going direct.

797
00:47:32,640 --> 00:47:34,840
哈蒙德：杰里米是在贴地狂飙。
HAMMOND: Jeremy was flying.

798
00:47:34,880 --> 00:47:38,680
但在他头顶5000英尺处，
我们飞得比他还要快。
But 5,000 feet above him,
we were flying faster.

799
00:47:38,720 --> 00:47:42,320
我们眼看就要拿下头名了，
然而，你猜怎么着？
We were about to take
the lead, but then,
guess what?

800
00:47:42,360 --> 00:47:45,720
詹姆斯又带来了
一个坏消息。
James delivered
yet more bad news.

801
00:47:45,760 --> 00:47:48,600
哈蒙德，有件事
我得跟你交代一下。
There is one thing I need to
tell you about, Hammond.

802
00:47:49,200 --> 00:47:51,160
啥事？
What?

803
00:47:51,200 --> 00:47:53,960
-就咱们那句“英格兰，我们来啦”。
-是啊，怎么了。
-This idea about England,
here we come.
-That's the idea.

804
00:47:54,000 --> 00:47:56,600
问题是，因为咱们刚才耽搁了一会儿，
Well, the thing is,
because we were a bit delayed,

805
00:47:56,640 --> 00:48:00,360
呃……等飞到法国北部的时候，
天就要黑了。
it's, um, it's gonna get dark
while we're still in northern
France.

806
00:48:00,400 --> 00:48:03,040
咱们有机灯啊，
开灯不就行了。
We've got lights.
Turn them on.

807
00:48:03,080 --> 00:48:05,560
不行，天黑以后
我是不准开这玩意的。
No, but I'm not allowed
to fly this thing in the dark.

808
00:48:05,600 --> 00:48:09,720
-什么？！
-我没夜航资质。
真的很抱歉，哈蒙德。
-What?
-I'm not qualified.
I'm really sorry, Hammond.

809
00:48:11,840 --> 00:48:14,560
好吧。
那咱们现在怎么办？
Right.
So what do we do?

810
00:48:14,600 --> 00:48:16,200
呃，降落。
Uh, we land.

811
00:48:16,240 --> 00:48:19,480
-[手机铃声]
-鼹鼠，你们现在是不是正在全速狂飙啊？
-[MOBILE RINGING]
-Hamster, are you really
hammering along now?

812
00:48:19,520 --> 00:48:21,200
我们摊上大麻烦了。
We do have problems.

813
00:48:21,240 --> 00:48:24,400
詹姆斯刚告诉我，他还没考过
James has just told me that he
hasn't done the test that

814
00:48:24,440 --> 00:48:26,560
允许他在夜间
开飞机的考试。
allows him to drive
the plane at night.

815
00:48:26,600 --> 00:48:28,760
[大笑]
[LAUGHING]

816
00:48:28,800 --> 00:48:33,200
所以我们不得不降落。
原话是：
“找个地方降。可能是里尔。”
So, we're gonna have to land.
And I quote,
"Somewhere. Maybe Lille."

817
00:48:33,240 --> 00:48:35,600
克拉克森：他脑子压根就没想清楚，是吧？
CLARKSON: He really hasn't
thought this through, has he?

818
00:48:36,560 --> 00:48:38,760
他把电话挂了。
He's gone.

819
00:48:38,800 --> 00:48:42,200
克拉克森：这个喜讯让我得以把警报降回三级戒备，
CLARKSON: The news enabled
me to switch back to DEFCON 3

820
00:48:42,240 --> 00:48:45,560
并且有闲心再品味一下开车的乐趣。
and reflect some more
on the joys of driving.

821
00:48:51,320 --> 00:48:54,520
说真的，汽车最绝妙的一点，
Perhaps the most marvellous
thing, really, about the car

822
00:48:54,560 --> 00:48:57,640
大概就是当天色暗下来时，
你根本用不着停车靠边。
is that when it starts
to go dark, you don't
have to park.

823
00:48:57,680 --> 00:49:01,760
你只要打开车灯，
就能继续一路狂奔。
You just put your lights on
and keep right on going.

824
00:49:28,520 --> 00:49:32,160
哈蒙德：如果我们能在天黑前赶到里尔，就还有机会
HAMMOND: If we could
make Lille before night fell,
we were in with a chance

825
00:49:32,200 --> 00:49:35,760
搭上开往伦敦的“欧洲之星”，
继续留在比赛中。
of catching the Eurostar
to London, and staying in
the race.

826
00:49:37,840 --> 00:49:41,680
他们还在里尔以南100英里，
我离里尔南边只有90英里了。
They're 100 miles south
of Lille. I'm 90 miles south
of Lille.

827
00:49:43,480 --> 00:49:45,560
我随时都能看见他们了！
I'm going to see
them any minute!

828
00:49:45,600 --> 00:49:47,880
-光线还撑得住吗？
-能，但我必须赶在
-Are we still all
right for light?
-Yeah I've got to land before

829
00:49:47,920 --> 00:49:51,840
太阳落山前降落。
严格来说，是日落前十分钟。
the sun goes down.
Ten minutes before it goes
down, strictly speaking.

830
00:49:51,880 --> 00:49:54,520
这时间卡得也太极限了！
This is gonna be so close!

831
00:49:54,560 --> 00:49:57,080
求你赶紧专心飞吧，
开好你的飞机就行。
Please carry on flying, now.
Just drive the plane.

832
00:49:58,560 --> 00:50:01,720
我绝不能让这台——人类有史以来最棒的跑车，
I can't let this,
not the best car ever made,

833
00:50:01,760 --> 00:50:04,640
输给詹姆斯那台会飞的洗衣机。
be beaten by James'
flying washing machine.

834
00:50:07,720 --> 00:50:13,080
梅：[无线电听不清]
……进五边，18号跑道。
MAY: [SPEAKING INDISTINCTLY]
...final, runway 18.

835
00:50:13,120 --> 00:50:15,680
顺序可能报错了，
不过大差不差。
That's probably the wrong
order, but it's roughly right.

836
00:50:18,200 --> 00:50:19,280
你还好吧，哈蒙德？
You all right, Hammond?

837
00:50:19,320 --> 00:50:20,880
好的很，赶紧落地吧。
Oh, yes. Just land.

838
00:50:20,920 --> 00:50:22,680
这有点棘手啊老兄，风太大了。
It's tricky, man, it's windy.

839
00:50:32,280 --> 00:50:36,320
哈蒙德：我们在最后一刻惊险降落在了里尔。
HAMMOND: We landed in Lille
with moments to spare.

840
00:50:36,360 --> 00:50:39,800
-[手机铃声]
-克拉克森：鼹鼠，你们在哪儿呢？落地了吗？
-[MOBILE RINGING]
-CLARKSON: Hamster, where are
you? Are you down?

841
00:50:39,840 --> 00:50:43,120
-你们现在肯定已经落地了吧。
-落了，是的。
你到哪了？
-You must be down by now.
-We're down, yeah.
Where are you?

842
00:50:43,160 --> 00:50:46,320
呃，我大概
离加来还有70英里。
Well, I'm about
70 miles from Calais.

843
00:50:46,360 --> 00:50:47,840
行！很好！妥了。
Right! Okay! That's good.

844
00:50:47,880 --> 00:50:49,240
搞快点。
Come on.

845
00:50:49,280 --> 00:50:51,320
-火车挺快的。
-好消息是，
-The train's fast.
-The good thing is

846
00:50:51,360 --> 00:50:53,920
这一局比赛真的要
咬得难解难分了。
is this is going to
be seriously close.

847
00:50:53,960 --> 00:50:56,440
噢，你信号断……他挂了。
Oh, you're dis... He's gone.

848
00:50:56,480 --> 00:50:58,960
算了，反正我也无所谓。
不是走那边，
是走这边。
Never mind. I don't really
care. It's not that way,
it's this way.

849
00:51:00,760 --> 00:51:04,080
-梅：我在跑呢！
-没错，你居然跑起来了！
[笑声]
-MAY: I'm running!
-Yes, you're running!
[LAUGHING]

850
00:51:06,280 --> 00:51:09,040
走吧，你可千万别试着
开这玩意起飞啊。
Go, just don't try
and fly this, will you.

851
00:51:09,080 --> 00:51:13,080
-火车站。
叫什么名字来着？
-火车站，TGV高铁……
-Train station.
What's the name?
-Train station, TGV...

852
00:51:13,120 --> 00:51:16,120
哈蒙德：我们在飞机上
几乎就要追上杰里米了。
HAMMOND: We'd so nearly
caught Jeremy up in the plane.

853
00:51:16,160 --> 00:51:19,040
但现在我们只能挤在公交车上，
慢慢悠悠地晃向火车站。
But now we were on a bus,
going to the railway station.

854
00:51:19,080 --> 00:51:21,760
而他的领先优势
正在一分一秒地扩大。
His lead was increasing
by the moment.

855
00:51:23,240 --> 00:51:25,320
好了，火车站到了。
Now, train station.

856
00:51:25,360 --> 00:51:27,000
行，欧洲之星。坐这趟。
Right. Eurostar. That's us.

857
00:51:28,440 --> 00:51:31,080
法国北部这一片
可真够无聊的。
This bit of northern France
isn't half dull.

858
00:51:32,920 --> 00:51:34,720
——当然，前提是你没开布加迪。
When you're not in a Bugatti,
that is.

859
00:51:37,040 --> 00:51:38,520
这破烟真是
越来越难抽了。
These things are
getting worse.

860
00:51:38,560 --> 00:51:40,640
抽起来跟把死狗装进袋子里一样呛人。
It's like a dead dog in a bag.

861
00:51:44,440 --> 00:51:46,280
太爽了！真痛快。
Yes! This is a good thing.

862
00:51:50,920 --> 00:51:55,000
好了，我们到了。
我杀到加来了。漂亮！
Well, here we are.
I've made it to Calais. Yes!

863
00:51:58,360 --> 00:52:00,960
我倒不是想煞风景什么的，
I don't want to lower the tone
or anything,

864
00:52:01,000 --> 00:52:05,760
但我从意大利出发后就没上过厕所，
现在膀胱都快憋炸了。
but I haven't been to the loo
since Italy, and I'm begging
for it.

865
00:52:05,800 --> 00:52:09,840
那边几个厕所全挂着“暂停使用”，
而那头停了整整42辆英国大巴，
The ones that way are out of
order, and there's 42 British
coaches through there,

866
00:52:09,880 --> 00:52:10,880
车上所有人
还都排着队想要我的签名。
and they all want
my autograph.

867
00:52:13,560 --> 00:52:15,640
Avez-vous le beer？（有啤酒吗？）
Avez-vous lebeer?

868
00:52:17,240 --> 00:52:18,960
克拉克森：噢！
CLARKSON: Oh!

869
00:52:19,560 --> 00:52:20,920
噢，爽啊！
Oh, yeah!

870
00:52:31,000 --> 00:52:33,960
[奏响《天佑女王》]
[GOD SAVE THE QUEENPLAYING]

871
00:52:50,240 --> 00:52:54,040
克拉克森：我回到英国时，
比“金毛”和“阿吉”早了半个小时。
CLARKSON: I'd arrived back
in Britain half an hour
in front of Ginger and Algy.

872
00:52:54,080 --> 00:52:56,720
但是，他们追得极快。
But, they were gaining fast.

873
00:52:57,840 --> 00:52:59,760
[手机铃声]
[MOBILE RINGING]

874
00:52:59,800 --> 00:53:02,040
克拉克森：鼹鼠，
你那边如何？
CLARKSON: Hamster,
how are you?

875
00:53:02,080 --> 00:53:05,600
我们坐上火车了，一切顺利得很。
还有35分钟到滑铁卢站。
We're on our train and we're
doing quite nicely. We're 35
minutes from Waterloo.

876
00:53:05,640 --> 00:53:07,560
哈蒙德：
胜负又要到最后一秒才能见分晓了。
HAMMOND:
It is down to the wire, again.

877
00:53:07,600 --> 00:53:10,280
说不定下一秒，
就能看见你的车灯从窗外一闪而过了。
Any minute now,
we'll see your headlights
sweep past the window.

878
00:53:10,320 --> 00:53:11,800
克拉克森：
愿最强的人获胜。
CLARKSON:
May the best man win.

879
00:53:14,320 --> 00:53:17,720
真正的决战，现在才刚刚开始。
The race actually starts, now.

880
00:53:20,960 --> 00:53:23,840
黑墙隧道。
走这儿快吗？
Blackwall Tunnel.
Is that good?

881
00:53:25,760 --> 00:53:29,200
我不知道，
我只知道时间紧迫。
I don't know,
I just know time is tight.

882
00:53:37,920 --> 00:53:40,840
这可是我13个小时以来
停在原地最久的一次。
This is the longest I've been
stationary in 13 hours.

883
00:53:43,200 --> 00:53:46,920
-咱们现在得靠跑的了，对吧？
-没错。
-We've gotta run now,
hadn't we?
-Yes.

884
00:53:46,960 --> 00:53:49,720
-上哪儿坐夜班大巴？
-就在外头。
-Where do you get
these night buses?
-Right outside.

885
00:53:49,760 --> 00:53:51,240
能用松露付车费吗？
Can you pay them in truffles?

886
00:53:53,560 --> 00:53:54,680
出口在这边！
Way out!

887
00:53:56,000 --> 00:53:57,280
快点。
Come on.

888
00:53:58,160 --> 00:53:59,400
詹姆斯：就是这辆！就是这辆！
MAY: This is it! This is it!

889
00:53:59,440 --> 00:54:00,720
哈蒙德：太棒了。
HAMMOND: Excellent.

890
00:54:01,240 --> 00:54:03,760
走，快开！
Go. Drive.

891
00:54:03,800 --> 00:54:07,200
噢，我看见我认识的
伦敦地界了。
Ooh, I see bits of London
that I recognise.

892
00:54:07,240 --> 00:54:08,760
是金丝雀码头。
It's Canary Wharf.

893
00:54:10,320 --> 00:54:11,680
太棒了！
Yes!

894
00:54:13,280 --> 00:54:16,680
-这就是公共交通的精髓：死等。
-开啊！快开！
-This is what public transport
is about. Waiting.
-Drive! Drive!

895
00:54:16,720 --> 00:54:18,600
他开的是布加迪，
我们坐的是大巴。
He's got a Bugatti,
we've got a bus.

896
00:54:23,160 --> 00:54:27,960
我今天钻过的所有隧道，
那叫一个平整、干净、宽敞。
All those tunnels I've been in
today. Smooth, neat and big.

897
00:54:28,000 --> 00:54:30,680
眼前这个看着
简直像个公厕。
This one looks like
a public convenience.

898
00:54:34,200 --> 00:54:36,560
任何从后头追上来的车
都可能是那辆布加迪。
Whatever comes up behind
us could be a Bugatti.

899
00:54:40,800 --> 00:54:42,640
刚才那是奥德维奇。没错。
That was the Aldwych. Yes.

900
00:54:43,440 --> 00:54:47,440
进金融城了。
This is the city.

901
00:54:47,480 --> 00:54:50,520
-到了！在那儿！
就差几分钟了！
-快拿行李！
-There it is! There it is!
We're minutes away!
-Let's get our bags.

902
00:54:50,560 --> 00:54:51,760
快，冲，冲！
Go. go. go.

903
00:54:53,520 --> 00:54:54,920
又是一个红灯。
Another red light.

904
00:54:54,960 --> 00:54:57,080
-詹姆斯！
-来了来了！
-James!
-Yeah, I'm coming.

905
00:54:57,120 --> 00:54:59,200
-就是那儿！
-［笑声］
-That's it!
-[LAUGHING]

906
00:55:02,560 --> 00:55:07,680
到了，国民西敏寺大厦！我到了！
他们到了吗？
This is it. It's the NatWest
Tower! I'm here!
Are they here?

907
00:55:08,840 --> 00:55:09,640
快跑！
Come on!

908
00:55:13,840 --> 00:55:15,320
噢，糟糕，麻烦大了。
Oh, trouble, trouble.

909
00:55:19,880 --> 00:55:23,440
克拉克森：这座大楼简直就是个迷宫，
底层根本没有直达
CLARKSON: The tower was a
maze with no direct lift from
the bottom to the finish line

910
00:55:23,480 --> 00:55:25,760
42层终点的电梯。
on the 42nd floor.

911
00:55:25,800 --> 00:55:27,720
哈蒙德：B电梯坐到21层……
HAMMOND: B to 21...

912
00:55:28,600 --> 00:55:31,680
21层换乘别的
才能上到42层。
21 transfer to something
to go to 42.

913
00:55:31,720 --> 00:55:33,680
对，这就说得通了，看。
Yeah, that makes sense, look.

914
00:55:33,720 --> 00:55:36,320
-B区。
-进。
-B.
-In.

915
00:55:36,360 --> 00:55:39,000
换乘D组电梯。
Transfer to lift group D.

916
00:55:39,040 --> 00:55:40,200
［电梯轻音乐］
[MUZAK PLAYING]

917
00:55:40,240 --> 00:55:41,680
［痛苦呻吟］
[GROANING]

918
00:55:44,320 --> 00:55:46,400
他们就不能装个直达电梯吗？！
Why don't they
just have a lift?

919
00:55:46,440 --> 00:55:48,160
快！看箭头！这边！
Go! Arrows! This way!

920
00:55:48,200 --> 00:55:50,320
往右。不对，等等。
Right. No, hang on.

921
00:55:50,360 --> 00:55:52,760
-不是这层。
-嗷！
-That's not it.
-Oh!

922
00:55:52,800 --> 00:55:55,800
打扰一下，
请问42楼怎么走？
Excuse me.
Do you know how to get to 42?

923
00:55:57,040 --> 00:55:59,600
坐到41楼，
电梯最高只能到那儿。
41. As high as you
can go in the lift.

924
00:55:59,640 --> 00:56:02,560
-到41楼再走上去？好的，太感谢了。再见。
-对。
-41 and walk? Okay, thanks
ever so much. Bye.
-Yeah.

925
00:56:03,240 --> 00:56:05,480
什么破大楼！
What a stupid building!

926
00:56:05,520 --> 00:56:08,680
-34、35、36……
-35、36……
-34, 35, 36...
-35, 36...

927
00:56:09,280 --> 00:56:10,280
[呜咽哀鸣]
[WHIMPERS]

928
00:56:11,360 --> 00:56:12,960
冲！
Go!

929
00:56:13,000 --> 00:56:15,080
-走楼梯！
-老兄，我吓得心都要跳出来了！
-Stairs!
-Oh, mate, I'm terrified!

930
00:56:15,120 --> 00:56:16,720
-成败就在此一举了，哈蒙德。
-就是这儿了！
-But this it, Hammond.
-This is it!

931
00:56:16,760 --> 00:56:18,760
[哈蒙德与梅上气不接下气地说话]
[HAMMOND AND MAY
SPEAKING INDISTINCTLY]

932
00:56:19,680 --> 00:56:22,280
两人合：晚上好。
BOTH: Good evening.

933
00:56:22,320 --> 00:56:26,960
呃，我都懵了。
搞不懂，这是算我们赢了吗？他人呢？
Um, I don't know.
I'm confused. Does that mean
we've won? Where is he?

934
00:56:27,000 --> 00:56:30,360
依我看咱们赢了，
咱们到了，他连个人影都没有。
Well, I would say we've won.
We're here and he's not.

935
00:56:30,400 --> 00:56:34,200
-窗边那道影子……简直跟个幽灵似的！
-[大笑]
-That's a shadow, in the
window, of a ghostly figure!
-[LAUGHING]

936
00:56:35,120 --> 00:56:36,240
不会吧！
Surely not!

937
00:56:36,280 --> 00:56:37,520
[大笑]
[LAUGHING]

938
00:56:37,560 --> 00:56:39,240
太丧心病狂了！
That's horrible!

939
00:56:39,280 --> 00:56:43,440
你这个让人忍无可忍的家伙！
我简直受不了了！
You unbearable man!
I can't stand it!

940
00:56:43,480 --> 00:56:45,560
-呃！好吧。
-注意尊严。
-Ugh! Yes.
-Dignity.

941
00:56:45,600 --> 00:56:47,640
-你的松露带来了吗？
-带了。
-Have you got your truffle?
-Yes.

942
00:56:47,680 --> 00:56:49,800
真遗憾，
人家餐厅已经有一块了。
Well unfortunately
they've already got one.

943
00:56:49,840 --> 00:56:53,360
所以恐怕，
你那65镑算是彻底打了水漂。
So, I'm afraid you're
65 quid out of pocket.

944
00:56:53,400 --> 00:56:57,080
克拉克森：噢，棒极了。意面上刨了我的松露。
哈蒙德：噢，松露啊，真香。
CLARKSON: Oh, marvellous.
Pasta with my truffle on it.
HAMMOND: Oh, truffle. Good.

945
00:56:58,520 --> 00:57:00,160
其实这是一场挺空虚的胜利。
It's quite a hollow victory.

946
00:57:00,680 --> 00:57:02,440
-是吗？
-嗯。
-Is it?
-Mmm.

947
00:57:02,480 --> 00:57:05,640
因为在往后的余生里，我都不得不……
Because I've now got to go
for the rest of my life,

948
00:57:05,680 --> 00:57:08,760
清醒地承受自己永远不可能拥有那辆车的事实。
knowing that I'll
never own that car.

949
00:57:10,000 --> 00:57:13,000
我也再不可能体验到那种澎湃的动力了。
I'll never experience
that power again.

950
00:57:14,200 --> 00:57:15,920
这真是一种极其让人伤感的滋味。
And that is a really
sad feeling.

951
00:57:15,960 --> 00:57:18,040
莫名让人觉得像是一个时代的终结。
Like the end of an
era in an odd way.

952
00:57:18,080 --> 00:57:19,640
哈蒙德：也算是新时代的开端吧，只是……
HAMMOND: The beginning of
something new, but...

953
00:57:22,400 --> 00:57:24,000
[大笑]
[LAUGHING]

954
00:57:32,280 --> 00:57:34,400
[观众鼓掌喝彩]
[AUDIENCE APPLAUDING]

955
00:57:34,440 --> 00:57:39,960
看呐，就是它了。
Now, this, is it.

956
00:57:42,400 --> 00:57:44,760
简直难以置信。
It's unbelievable.

957
00:57:45,720 --> 00:57:48,880
我说詹姆斯，“开”飞机挺累人的吧？
So, James, tiring is it,
driving a plane?

958
00:57:48,920 --> 00:57:50,560
是啊，我都快累死了。
Yeah. I was dead.

959
00:57:50,600 --> 00:57:53,760
你根本不知道他当时离真死有多近。
You've no idea how
close he came to really
being dead.

960
00:57:53,800 --> 00:57:55,560
[观众大笑]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

961
00:57:55,600 --> 00:57:58,280
你根本不知道
作为同机的乘客，
你有多招人烦。
You've no idea
what an irritating
airline passenger you are.

962
00:57:58,320 --> 00:58:01,160
-得了吧你！
-换作是我，
早给你打上一针镇静剂
-Oh, come on!
-No, I would have
had you sedated

963
00:58:01,200 --> 00:58:04,400
-直接捆在座位上了，
就像对付那些撒酒疯的醉鬼一样。
-我还巴不得被麻醉呢。
-and strapped to the seat,
like one of those drunkards.
-I wish I had been sedated.

964
00:58:04,440 --> 00:58:08,280
拜托你们，别吵了。
我有个严肃的问题要问，
听好了？
Just please, stop bickering.
Because I've got this question
to ask, okay?

965
00:58:08,320 --> 00:58:12,240
你们觉得大众造这辆车，
每台实际
到底花了多少成本？
How much do you think
it cost Volkswagen to
actually make this car?

966
00:58:12,280 --> 00:58:13,440
完全没概念。
No idea.

967
00:58:13,480 --> 00:58:14,800
500万英镑。
5,000,000 quid.

968
00:58:14,840 --> 00:58:16,360
-什么？每一台？
-每一台。
-What? Each car?
-Each car?

969
00:58:16,400 --> 00:58:18,600
-所以他们每卖一台都在巨亏？
-没错。
-So they're making a
huge loss on each one?
-Yeah.

970
00:58:18,640 --> 00:58:22,760
亏得底裤都不剩。他们造它纯粹是
为了搞一次技术挑战，
看看人类到底能不能做出来。
Making a huge loss. They did
it as a technical exercise
to see if it could be done.

971
00:58:22,800 --> 00:58:25,280
而让我担心的是，
在如今的大气候下，
你们懂的，
And what worries me, is that
in the current climate,
you know,

972
00:58:25,320 --> 00:58:27,520
股东们天天施压，
所有人又都在逼逼叨叨
全球变暖的事，
with shareholders and
everyone twittering on
about global warming,

973
00:58:27,560 --> 00:58:30,360
-以后再也不会有人造这种车了。
-是的，属于我们的
“协和时刻”已经落幕了。
-nobody's gonna do it again.
-No, we've had our
Concorde moment.

974
00:58:30,400 --> 00:58:35,160
一点没错。它就是汽车界的协和客机。
不仅是有史以来造出的最棒的汽车，
Exactly. This is Concorde.
Not just the best car that's
ever been made,

975
00:58:35,200 --> 00:58:39,080
而且极有可能，
也是我们这辈子
能见到的最巅峰之作。
but, very possibly,
the best car we'll see
in our lifetime.

976
00:58:39,120 --> 00:58:43,600
在这个略显悲伤的
重磅炸弹消息中，本期节目就到这里了。
And on that rather sad
bombshell, it's time to
end the show.

977
00:58:43,640 --> 00:58:46,200
下周我们停播，
因为好像有一帮老爷们
要来这儿打台球什么的。
We're not here next week
'cause some men are coming
playing billiards, I think.

978
00:58:46,240 --> 00:58:48,080
-差不多是这玩意儿吧。
-八成是这样。
-Something, yeah.
-Something like that.

979
00:58:48,120 --> 00:58:50,760
所以，我们12月27号回归。
届时再见，晚安！
So, we'll be back on
December 27th.
We'll see you then. Goodnight.

